From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pravalika Gurram <pravalika.gurram@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 10:06:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] drm/xe: fallback implementation for single-pass MMU notifier
 support

Add compatibility support for older kernel versions that use single-pass
MMU interval notifier callbacks instead of the two-pass interface.

Provide fallback implementations for TLB invalidation and MMU notifier
callbacks to ensure the driver compiles and functions correctly on
kernels without the two-pass notifier interface.

- Implement xe_vm_range_tilemask_tlb_inval() as single-pass TLB
  invalidation fallback
- Add single-pass MMU notifier callback for userptr invalidation
  kernel versions

Reference:
    7aba71dbc416
    mm/mmu_notifier: Allow two-pass struct mmu_interval_notifiers

Signed-off-by: Pravalika Gurram <pravalika.gurram@intel.com>
